                                "sense_id": "300a0757-85b9-3f3d-8c79-96284d6f62a9",
                                "text": "\"[…] Mrs. Sedley had forgiven his breaking the punch-bowl at the child's party. Don't you remember the catastrophe, Ma'am, seven years ago?\"\n\"Over Mrs. Flamingo's crimson silk gown,\" said good-natured Mrs. Sedley. \"What a gawky it was! And his sisters are not much more graceful. Lady Dobbin was at Highbury last night with three of them. Such figures! my dears.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bb3d183-b6a7-4e82-a56a-2d73480f8f06",
                                "sense_id": "300a0757-85b9-3f3d-8c79-96284d6f62a9",
                                "text": "Let not the inconveniently tall, the gawkies, the Maypoles, despair."
